# Path, bucket, purpose. No measured port-effort claim is derived from this inventory.
patches/apr-1.7.4-0001-freestanding-includes.patch compat the census seam as a patch: fourteen includes become one shim
patches/apr-1.7.4-0002-node-lifetime-hooks.patch allocator node transitions on the free list, backing and metadata heap
../adapted/apr_shim.h compat freestanding interface to upstream apr_pools.c, shared with the census
src/shared/port.h glue fixed-width protocol and adapter interface
src/shared/metadata.c glue metadata heap for adapter records and the allocator struct
src/shared/services.c glue the nine off-path services apr_pools.c references, each ending the run
src/allocators/sublet/node-leases.c allocator retained node authority, revoked on release and issue
src/native/node-pointers.c glue hosted node backing with plain pointers, mode 0 only
src/cheribsd/node-malloc.c glue stock CheriBSD: nodes from the platform's malloc, mode 0 only
security-tests/cheribsd/revocation-control.c test libc revocation made to fire at the corpus's labelled load
host/cheribsd/build.sh test shared CheriBSD build entry
host/cheribsd/run.sh test shared CheriBSD run entry
src/native/main.c test hosted entry through the seam
src/capstone-domain/entry.c test domain entry and shared region setup
src/linux-guest/domain-loader.c test guest domain loader
examples/pools.c test direct-link client that must observe the node reissue
tests/native/test-source.py test patch order, duplicate rejection, preservation on failure
patches/apr-util/apr-util-1.6.3-0001-freestanding-includes.patch compat the bucket allocator's census seam as a patch: five includes and stdlib become one shim
patches/apr-util/apr-util-1.6.3-0002-bucket-lifetime-hooks.patch allocator the bucket allocator's transitions: lend, carve, file, reissue, blocks returning, probe
../adapted/apr_bucket_shim.h compat freestanding interface to upstream apr_buckets_alloc.c, geometry carried verbatim, shared with the census
upstream-apr-util.json glue the apr-util 1.6.3 pin
cmake/APRUtilSource.cmake glue apr-util's archive and patch series prepared beside APR's
src/allocators/sublet/bucket-leases.c allocator a piece per bucket node under the block's senior handle, the freelist by index
src/native/bucket-pointers.c glue hosted and CheriBSD bucket seam with plain pointers, same records and LIFO
security-tests/capstone-domain/bucket-lifetimes.c test seven bucket lifetime fixtures, one program, the fixture from the trace
security-tests/qemu/run-buckets.py test the fixtures' runner and oracle
examples/buckets.c test direct-link client that must observe the LIFO reissue
tests/native/test-apr-util-source.py test apr-util patch order, duplicate rejection, byte identity

